  "rewrites": {
   "7": {
    "original": "Thornton Lockwood, senior director of Clemson University's Center for Educational Technology, doesn't blame Kohli, and he says UTSA should have gotten rid of the poorly cited and plagiarized bit, but he suggests care when it comes to the Internet, which is so easily mined for pieces and useful information.",
